WEBVTT

00:09.756 --> 00:15.549
♪ La la la la la la la ♪
Hi, Patrick!
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦 ♪
嗨，帕特里克！

00:15.549 --> 00:19.101
I just had another great--
wait a minute.
我刚刚又经历了一次伟大的——
等一下。

00:20.652 --> 00:22.480
Hey, what's wrong?
嘿，怎么了？

00:22.480 --> 00:26.515
I think I'm growing a nose.
我觉得我的鼻子要长了

00:27.687 --> 00:29.825
I don't want a nose!
我不要鼻子！

00:29.825 --> 00:31.549
Patrick, wait!
帕特里克，等等！

00:36.239 --> 00:39.308
Hey, look, Patrick.
You just lost a tooth.
嘿，看，帕特里克。
你刚刚失去了一颗牙齿。

00:39.308 --> 00:41.997
And if you put that tooth
under your pillow tonight,
如果你把那颗牙齿
今晚你的枕头底下，

00:41.997 --> 00:44.963
the Tooth Fairy with come
and take the tooth
牙仙子来了
并取出牙齿

00:44.963 --> 00:47.446
and leave you a quarter.
并留给你四分之一。

00:47.446 --> 00:51.170
A quarter for just one tooth?
四分之一只换一颗牙齿？

01:00.928 --> 01:03.101
Jackpot!
大奖！

01:05.204 --> 01:08.135
Good night, teethies.
晚安，牙牙们。

01:29.859 --> 01:33.515
Who says a life
of crime doesn't pay?
谁说一生
犯罪没有报酬？

01:34.446 --> 01:36.446
Huh?
啊？

01:36.446 --> 01:38.618
Sleep punch!
睡觉打拳！

01:38.618 --> 01:42.859
Whoa! Ow!
哇！噢！

01:50.618 --> 01:52.446
Who goes there?
谁去那里？

01:58.170 --> 02:00.583
The Tooth Fairy!
牙仙子！

02:00.583 --> 02:02.687
I gotta show SpongeBob!
我要给海绵宝宝看！

02:02.687 --> 02:04.963
Hey, come on!
嘿，来吧！

02:10.066 --> 02:12.411
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

02:12.411 --> 02:14.480
You were right!
你是对的！

02:14.480 --> 02:18.135
The Tooth Fairy came,
and I got him!
牙仙子来了，
我抓住了他！

02:18.135 --> 02:19.721
Ahh!
啊！

02:21.032 --> 02:24.273
Ooh!
哦！

02:24.273 --> 02:27.170
I didn't do it!
我没有做！

02:28.721 --> 02:33.687
Patrick, you-you-you really
did catch the Tooth Fairy!
帕特里克，你-你-你真的
确实抓住了牙仙子！

02:33.687 --> 02:37.997
I told ya!
我告诉你了！

02:40.928 --> 02:43.583
Wow.
哇。

02:45.239 --> 02:48.756
He didn't give me a quarter,
but look.
他没有给我五分钱，
但你看。

02:48.756 --> 02:52.101
I found these precious jewels
in his bag.
我找到了这些珍贵的珠宝
在他的包里。

02:52.101 --> 02:54.721
What are you chowderheads
yapping about?
你们是什么杂烩
喋喋不休？

02:54.721 --> 02:57.549
Tooth Fairy?
- Don't worry.
牙仙子？
- 不用担心。

02:57.549 --> 02:59.411
You don't have
to play dumb with us.
你没有
和我们一起装傻。

02:59.411 --> 03:01.756
Your secret is safe.
你的秘密是安全的。

03:01.756 --> 03:04.652
Please let us ride along
with you tonight.
请让我们一起骑行
今晚和你在一起。

03:04.652 --> 03:06.721
And be your Tooth Fairy assistants.
成为您的牙仙助手。

03:09.618 --> 03:12.239
Yeah.
是的。

03:12.239 --> 03:14.204
I'm the Tooth Fairy.
我是牙仙子

03:14.204 --> 03:16.756
And I could use
a little help scoring loot--
我可以用
对获得战利品有一点帮助——

03:16.756 --> 03:20.342
I mean, collecting teeth.
我的意思是，收集牙齿。

03:20.342 --> 03:22.928
both: Yay!
两人：耶！

03:22.928 --> 03:25.756
It's gonna be a long night.
这将是一个漫长的夜晚。

03:35.066 --> 03:36.618
Ooh, hey!
哦，嘿！

03:36.618 --> 03:38.411
I bet we could find
some teeth here.
我打赌我们能找到
这里有一些牙齿。

03:38.411 --> 03:42.032
Pull over.
- Ahh!
套衫。
- 啊！

03:44.342 --> 03:46.790
Now, this guy drinks
a lot of soda,
现在，这家伙喝酒了
很多苏打水，

03:46.790 --> 03:49.721
so I'm sure he's got
a few loose teeth for us.
所以我确信他有
给我们一些松动的牙齿。

03:49.721 --> 03:51.687
Let's get him.
我们来抓住他吧。

03:51.687 --> 03:57.446
Here, use these special
Tooth Fairy masks.
在这里，使用这些特殊的
牙仙面具。

04:01.170 --> 04:03.170
Ha-ha-ha!
哈哈哈！

04:34.170 --> 04:35.721
Amateurs.
业余爱好者。

04:35.721 --> 04:38.170
- Hey, look, it's Bubble--
- Can it!
- 嘿，看，这是泡泡--
- 可以吗！

04:38.170 --> 04:42.066
Now, why don't you mugs shake
down Tiny here for some teeth?
现在，你的杯子为什么不摇动
小小在这里找牙齿吗？

04:42.066 --> 04:45.583
I'm gonna look for teeth
in those valuables over there.
我要找牙齿
在那儿的那些贵重物品里。

04:47.618 --> 04:49.135
Huh?
啊？

04:49.135 --> 04:51.583
Only the Tooth Fairy gets
to laugh like that.
只有牙仙子才能得到
像那样笑。

04:51.583 --> 04:53.721
Shh.
嘘。

04:57.204 --> 04:59.618
I don't feel any teeth, Patrick.
我感觉不到任何牙齿，帕特里克。

04:59.618 --> 05:02.549
Well, I feel a bunch of them.
嗯，我感觉有很多。

05:04.583 --> 05:05.894
Ooh.
哦。

05:05.894 --> 05:07.652
This one's really loose.
这个实在是太松了

05:07.652 --> 05:11.239
I'm sure the Tooth Fairy won't
mind if we help it out.
我确信牙仙子不会
介意我们帮忙解决吗。

05:14.515 --> 05:15.894
Ah!
啊!

05:15.894 --> 05:18.170
Barnacle Boy!
藤壶男孩！

05:18.170 --> 05:19.721
Hmm.
唔。

05:28.894 --> 05:31.135
Agh!
啊啊！

05:33.101 --> 05:36.756
Ooh, is this where you keep
the pillow money?
哦，这就是你放的地方吗
枕头钱？

05:38.652 --> 05:41.446
Wow, teeth are sure worth a lot
these days.
哇，牙齿确实很值钱
这些天。

05:46.135 --> 05:48.583
Come on, let's get
more teeth.
来吧，我们来吧
更多牙齿。

05:48.583 --> 05:51.446
You've got the best job ever.
你已经得到了有史以来最好的工作。

06:00.997 --> 06:03.066
Whoa--oof!
哇——噢！

06:05.583 --> 06:07.515
both: Ooh.
两人：哦。

06:18.239 --> 06:20.687
both: Whoa!
两人：哇！

06:20.687 --> 06:22.652
Whoa!
哇！

06:22.652 --> 06:25.377
Oh, oh!
哦，哦！

06:25.377 --> 06:27.135
Mm.
毫米。

06:28.928 --> 06:30.342
Whoa.
哇哦。

06:49.549 --> 06:51.308
Right, ah, oh.
对啊，哦。

06:53.411 --> 06:55.515
Ahh!
啊！

07:05.308 --> 07:07.825
You stooges really gave
the Tooth Fairy
你们这些傀儡真的付出了
牙仙子

07:07.825 --> 07:09.790
a lot of help tonight.
今晚有很多帮助。

07:09.790 --> 07:12.308
Even if you also gave me
a headache.
就算你也给了我
头痛。

07:12.308 --> 07:15.170
I like helping!
我喜欢帮忙！

07:15.170 --> 07:18.963
Well, I think we got time
for one last job
好吧，我想我们还有时间
最后一份工作

07:18.963 --> 07:20.756
if you're in.
如果你在的话。

07:20.756 --> 07:23.066
Hey!
That's where Mr. Krabs lives.
嘿！
那是蟹老板住的地方。

07:23.066 --> 07:27.273
He's my daytime boss.
You're my nighttime boss.
他是我白天的老板。
你是我的夜间老板。

07:38.204 --> 07:39.618
Wait.
等待。

07:39.618 --> 07:41.652
Watch out for booby traps.
小心陷阱。

07:41.652 --> 07:45.446
I helped Mr. Krabs install the
security system myself, so--
我帮蟹老板安装了
我自己的安全系统，所以——

07:45.446 --> 07:47.583
Here's one!
I'll disarm it!
这是一个！
我会解除它的武装！

07:47.583 --> 07:49.583
- Patrick, no!
- Oops.
- 帕特里克，不！
- 哎呀。

07:49.583 --> 07:51.549
Hello?
Who's down there?
你好？
谁在下面？

07:51.549 --> 07:52.997
I'm calling the police.
我要报警。

07:52.997 --> 07:55.308
Yes, police?
Come quick!
是的，警察？
快来吧！

07:55.308 --> 07:56.652
I heard a noise.
我听到一声响动。

07:56.652 --> 08:00.652
Oh, no, we woke him up!
Let's get out of here.
哦，不，我们把他吵醒了！
我们离开这里吧。

08:00.652 --> 08:02.446
Ahh!
啊！

08:02.446 --> 08:03.515
both: Shh!
两人：嘘！

08:03.515 --> 08:04.859
Whaa...
哇...

08:04.859 --> 08:07.411
ah, SpongeBob, Patrick.
啊，海绵宝宝，帕特里克。

08:07.411 --> 08:10.480
What in the name of Poseidon's
pantaloons are you doing?
以波塞冬之名
你在做什么吗？

08:10.480 --> 08:12.894
Why have you tripped
me burglar alarm?
为什么你绊倒了
我防盗报警器？

08:12.894 --> 08:15.342
And why do you have
those burglar sacks?
为什么你有
那些防盗袋？

08:15.342 --> 08:18.204
And why are you wearing
burglar masks?
你为什么穿着
防盗面具？

08:18.204 --> 08:20.273
And why are you
with that burglar?
而你为什么是
和那个窃贼？

08:20.273 --> 08:22.790
Wait a minute.
等一下。

08:22.790 --> 08:24.066
Are you burglars?
你们是窃贼吗？

08:24.066 --> 08:26.687
I'll take a burglar
with cheese.
我来抓贼
配奶酪。

08:26.687 --> 08:28.411
We're not burglars.
我们不是窃贼。

08:28.411 --> 08:30.687
We were just assisting
the Tooth Fairy here.
我们只是帮忙
牙仙子在这里。

08:30.687 --> 08:33.101
Hello.
你好。

08:33.101 --> 08:35.859
That ain't no Tooth Fairy.
I should know.
那不是牙仙子。
我应该知道。

08:35.859 --> 08:39.652
I sold all my teeth to the real
Tooth Fairy years ago.
我把我所有的牙齿都卖给了真人
几年前的牙仙子。

08:39.652 --> 08:42.342
Oh, no, the fuzz!
哦，不，是绒毛！

08:42.342 --> 08:44.066
You gotta get me out of here!
你得带我离开这里！

08:44.066 --> 08:45.446
I don't know.
我不知道。

08:45.446 --> 08:48.066
Mr. Krabs says you're not
the real Tooth Fairy.
蟹老板说你不是
真正的牙仙子。

08:48.066 --> 08:50.963
Huh?
Of course I am!
啊？
我当然是！

08:50.963 --> 08:53.411
You just gotta believe!
你只需要相信！

08:53.411 --> 08:55.342
That's all, yeah.
仅此而已，是的。

08:57.342 --> 09:01.273
I believe in you,
Tooth Fairy!
我相信你，
牙仙子！

09:03.032 --> 09:06.446
Goodbye, Mr. Krabs!
再见，蟹老板！

09:08.618 --> 09:11.170
Those two are so gullible.
那两个人真是太容易受骗了。

09:11.170 --> 09:14.859
Oh, look!
This rope says "pull me."
哦，看！
这根绳子说的是“拉我”。

09:14.859 --> 09:16.687
Wah!
哇！

09:31.756 --> 09:33.618
- Whoa!
- Ahh!
- 哇！
- 啊！

09:33.618 --> 09:35.342
We can't go any farther!
我们不能再走得更远了！

09:35.342 --> 09:38.170
The jig is up!
What are we gonna do?
吉吉起来了！
我们要做什么？

09:38.170 --> 09:41.480
You're a Tooth Fairy!
You can fly!
你是牙仙子！
你可以飞！

09:41.480 --> 09:43.066
Fly to safety!
飞向安全！

09:43.066 --> 09:45.583
What?
both: Fly!
什么？
两人：飞吧！

09:45.583 --> 09:47.515
Ahh!
啊！

09:50.997 --> 09:53.687
Don't forget your teeth!
别忘了你的牙齿！

09:55.825 --> 09:58.583
Or your boat!
或者你的船！

09:58.583 --> 10:01.273
Ahh!
啊！

10:01.928 --> 10:03.549
You know, Patrick,
I get the feeling
你知道，帕特里克，
我有感觉

10:03.549 --> 10:05.687
that wasn't
the real Tooth Fairy.
那不是
真正的牙仙子。

10:05.687 --> 10:08.273
Of course not!
当然不是！

10:08.273 --> 10:10.342
But I am!
但我是！

10:10.342 --> 10:13.480
The real Tooth Fairy?
真正的牙仙子？

10:13.480 --> 10:18.066
You two did a wonderful job
collecting teeth all night.
你们两个做得很好
整夜收集牙齿。

10:18.066 --> 10:20.859
Therefore, I'm going
to make you
因此，我要去
让你

10:20.859 --> 10:23.928
honorary Tooth Fairy assistants.
名誉牙仙助理。

10:23.928 --> 10:25.859
Abraca--
阿布拉卡——

10:25.859 --> 10:29.377
- Dental.
- Ooh.
- 牙科。
- 哦。

10:29.377 --> 10:30.997
both: Huh?
两人：啊？

10:35.170 --> 10:38.101
Ah, come on!
啊，来吧！

10:40.687 --> 10:42.618
A tooth!
一颗牙齿！

10:42.618 --> 10:44.859
And a quarter.
还有四分之一。

10:54.032 --> 10:57.377
Abraca-dental!
阿布拉卡牙科！

阿布拉卡牙科！